{"version":1,"content":"<p>西藏那曲市巴青縣22日晚發生7.0級地震，至23日中午已造成16人遇難、65人受傷，其中重傷11人、輕傷54人【相關報道】。</p><p>目前已安全轉移受災群眾12,489人。</p><p>從閉路電視畫面可見，地震發生時建築物劇烈搖晃，多名民眾慌忙逃離室內，衝到街上。</p><p>（新華社/路透社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:52.054185+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:01:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:58:44.808326+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.571270+00:00","content_hash":"06e2db85dcaffdd8d04962b3d9b727869ae6258d2ab77a3698d35c0c29e234f5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}